---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, OWNER_NAME } from '../consts';

const title = 'About Me';
const description =
  'Meet the person behind Cleaning by Cassi and learn how a lifetime of cleaning experience turned into a business built on heart, hard work, and helping others.';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={title} description={description} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<img
			src="/blog-placeholder-about.jpg"
			alt="About Cleaning By Cassi"
			width="1020"
			height="510"
			class="hero-image"
		/>
		<main>
			<div class="about-page">
				<!-- INTRO -->
				<section class="about-intro">
					<p class="eyebrow">The Person Behind the Clean ✨</p>
					<h1>Meet {OWNER_NAME}</h1>
					<p class="intro-text">
						Hi, I'm {OWNER_NAME}—the owner and the person behind {SITE_TITLE}!
					</p>
				</section>
				<!-- MY STORY -->
				<section class="about-section">
					<div class="section-heading">
						<span class="section-number">01</span>
						<div>
							<p class="eyebrow">My Story</p>
							<h2>Cleaning has always been a part of my life.</h2>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="section-content">
						<p>
							Cleaning has been a part of my life for as long as I can remember.
							I grew up watching my mom build and run her own cleaning business,
							and I spent my summers helping her. Without realizing it at the time,
							those experiences gave me the foundation for what would eventually
							become my own business.
						</p>
						<p>
							After my mom retired, I spent two years working for two different
							cleaning companies. Those experiences taught me a lot about the
							industry, but eventually I realized I wanted to take everything I
							had learned and create something of my own.
						</p>
						<div class="highlight-box">
							<span>✨</span>
							<div>
								<strong>A dream turned into something real.</strong>
								<p>
									In July 2025, I took the leap and started {SITE_TITLE}.
								</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</section>
				<!-- WHY CLEANING -->
				<section class="about-section">
					<div class="section-heading">
						<span class="section-number">02</span>
						<div>
							<p class="eyebrow">Why Cleaning?</p>
							<h2>I genuinely love what I do.</h2>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="section-content">
						<p>
							I chose cleaning because I genuinely enjoy it. There's something
							incredibly satisfying—and honestly, relaxing—about taking a space
							that needs some attention and turning it into a clean, refreshed
							home.
						</p>
						<p>
							I love seeing the transformation and knowing that the work I do can
							make someone's life just a little bit easier.
						</p>
						<p>
							Owning my own business also allows me to create a schedule that works
							with my family and my children's school schedules. That flexibility
							means I can do work that I love while still making time for the people
							who matter most to me.
						</p>
					</div>
				</section>
				<!-- CLIENTS -->
				<section class="about-section client-section">
					<div class="section-heading">
						<span class="section-number">03</span>
						<div>
							<p class="eyebrow">The Best Part</p>
							<h2>My clients. 💗</h2>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="section-content">
						<p>
							But my favorite part?
						</p>
						<p class="big-text">
							<strong>My clients.</strong>
						</p>
						<p>
							There's nothing better than leaving a home knowing my client is happy
							with the work I've done. That feeling of accomplishment is one of the
							biggest reasons I love what I do.
						</p>
						<p>
							And if you have pets, there's a pretty good chance I'll love them too!
							🐾 I'm an animal lover, so meeting my clients' furry family members
							is definitely one of the perks of the job.
						</p>
					</div>
				</section>
				<!-- ABOUT THE BUSINESS -->
				<section class="about-section business-section">
					<div class="section-heading">
						<span class="section-number">04</span>
						<div>
							<p class="eyebrow">About the Business</p>
							<h2>More than just a cleaning service.</h2>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="section-content">
						<p>
							{SITE_TITLE} was built on experience, hard work, and a genuine love
							for helping people feel better in their homes.
						</p>
						<p>
							I understand that life gets busy. Sometimes cleaning falls to the
							bottom of the list, and that's okay.
						</p>
						<p class="big-text">
							<strong>That's where I come in.</strong>
						</p>
						<p>
							My goal isn't just to clean your home—it's to give you back time,
							take something off your plate, and leave you with a space you can
							enjoy.
						</p>
					</div>
				</section>
				<!-- MY APPROACH -->
				<section class="about-section">
					<div class="section-heading">
						<span class="section-number">05</span>
						<div>
							<p class="eyebrow">My Approach</p>
							<h2>Your home is unique. Your cleaning should be too.</h2>
						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="section-content">
						<p>
							Every home is different, and every client has different needs. I
							believe your cleaning service should reflect that, which is why I
							take the time to understand what matters most to you and your home.
						</p>
						<div class="quote-box">
							<p>
								"I'm not just cleaning houses. I'm building relationships,
								one home at a time."
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</section>
				<!-- THANK YOU -->
				<section class="about-goodbye">
					<div class="goodbye-inner">
						<p class="eyebrow">From Me to You</p>
						<h2>Thank you for trusting Cleaning by Cassi. 💗</h2>
						<p>
							Thank you for considering {SITE_TITLE} and for trusting me with your
							home. I truly appreciate every client who gives me the opportunity
							to do what I love.
						</p>
						<p class="signature">
							— {OWNER_NAME}
						</p>
					</div>
				</section>
			</div>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.hero-image {
		display: block;
		width: 720px;
		max-width: calc(100% - 2em);
		margin: 2em auto 0 auto;
		border-radius: 12px;
	}
	.about-page {
		max-width: 900px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2rem 1.25rem 4rem;
	}
	.about-intro {
		text-align: center;
		padding: 3rem 0 5rem;
	}
	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.14em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: white;
	}
	.about-intro h1 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(2.7rem, 7vw, 5rem);
		line-height: 1;
	}
	.intro-text {
		max-width: 650px;
		margin: 1.5rem auto 0;
		font-size: 1.2rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}
	.about-section {
		margin: 0 0 5rem;
	}
	.section-heading {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1.25rem;
		align-items: flex-start;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}
	.section-number {
		flex-shrink: 0;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		width: 48px;
		height: 48px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #a855f7, #ec4899);
		color: white;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-weight: 700;
	}
	.section-heading h2 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
		line-height: 1.15;
	}
	.section-content {
		padding-left: 73px;
	}
	.section-content p {
		margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.85;
	}
	.highlight-box {
		display: flex;
		gap: 1rem;
		align-items: flex-start;
		margin-top: 2rem;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		border-radius: 1rem;
		background: linear-gradient(
			135deg,
			rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.1),
			rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.1)
		);
	}
	.highlight-box > span {
		font-size: 1.5rem;
	}
	.highlight-box strong {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
	}
	.highlight-box p {
		margin: 0.35rem 0 0;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}
	.big-text {
		font-size: 1.4rem !important;
	}
	.quote-box {
		margin-top: 2rem;
		padding: 2rem;
		border-left: 4px solid #ec4899;
		border-radius: 0 1rem 1rem 0;
		background: rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.08);
	}
	.quote-box p {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		font-style: italic;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}
	.about-goodbye {
		margin-top: 2rem;
		padding: 4rem 2rem;
		border-radius: 1.5rem;
		text-align: center;
		background: linear-gradient(
			135deg,
			rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12),
			rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.08),
			rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.12)
		);
	}
	.goodbye-inner {
		max-width: 650px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}
	.about-goodbye h2 {
		margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
		line-height: 1.15;
	}
	.about-goodbye p:not(.eyebrow):not(.signature) {
		font-size: 1.05rem;
		line-height: 1.8;
	}
	.signature {
		margin-top: 2rem;
		font-family: cursive;
		font-size: 1.6rem;
	}
	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.about-page {
			padding-inline: 1rem;
		}
		.section-heading {
			gap: 0.9rem;
		}
		.section-number {
			width: 40px;
			height: 40px;
			font-size: 0.75rem;
		}
		.section-content {
			padding-left: 0;
		}
		.about-section {
			margin-bottom: 4rem;
		}
		.about-intro {
			padding-bottom: 3.5rem;
		}
		.highlight-box {
			padding: 1.25rem;
		}
	}
</style>
